{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32062","headline":"上邠宁邢司徒 · 贾岛","name":"上邠宁邢司徒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"箭头破帖浑无敌，杖底敲球远有声。\n马走千蹄朝万乘，地分三郡拥双旌。\n春风欲尽山花发，晓角初吹客梦惊。\n不是邢公来镇此，长安西北未能行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}